//- The page's schema.org JSON-LD, for the <head> of a layout:
//-     include /vendor/plugin-structured-data/index
//- meta.structuredData is already serialised and escaped by the plugin
//- (no `<`, `>` or `&` left in it), so the unescaped `!=` cannot end the
//- script element. Pages without it get no tag at all.
if meta && meta.structuredData
    script(type="application/ld+json")!= meta.structuredData
